    "chunk_text": "gast w\u00e6s neahterne of lichoman al\u00e6ded, ond he geseah ma ondryrrlices ond eac JA16B12 Ond \u00f0a \u00f0a godes englas eft his gast brohtan to \u00fe\u00e6m lichoman, \u00fea locade he on his agenne JA16B16 \u00dees Fursing gewat eft of Scottum on Brytone, ond on Eastengla m\u00e6g\u00f0e he getimbrede JA16B18 \u00d0\u00e6t he dyde on Sigeberhtes dagum \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges. JA16B19 Ond \u00feanon he gewat ofer s\u00e6 in Gallia m\u00e6g\u00f0e to Clodfeo, Francna cyninge, ond \u00f0\u00e6r his JA16B21 Ond his lichoma reste\u00f0 on \u00f0\u00e6m tune Ferano, ond his geearnunga \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6ron oft beorhte JA17A1 On \u00f0one seofenteo\u00fean d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 seo geleornes \u00fe\u00e6s halgan munuces sancte JA17A3 Se gewat on westen \u00f0a he w\u00e6s on twentigum geara, ond on \u00f0\u00e6m he wunade, o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s JA17A7 \u00d0\u00e6r he f\u00e6ste hwilum twegen dagas, hwilum \u00fery tosomne, ond \u00f0onne he mete \u00feigde, \u00f0onne JA17A10 Ond hine \u00fe\u00e6r deofla costodon mid oferm\u00e6te uncl\u00e6ne luste, efne swa \u00fe\u00e6t hi eodon on niht JA17A12 \u00d0\u00e6r he geseah eac \u00feone fulan gast \u00fee men l\u00e6r\u00f0 unalyfede lustas. JA17A14 \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s sweart cniht ond lytel ond egeslic, ond he him s\u00e6de sylf \u00fe\u00e6t his nama w\u00e6re JA17A17 Hwilum \u00f0a deofol hine swungan \u00fe\u00e6t he ne mihte hine astyrigean ne noht cwe\u00f0an",
